city stores around the country.

454
00:22:46,001 --> 00:22:50,000
In the fast-changing world of the internet,
domain names are no longer free.

455
00:22:50,001 --> 00:22:54,001
Network Solutions, the company that
registers net domains, says effective

456
00:22:54,001 --> 00:22:58,000
