$50 annual fee to register.

457
00:22:58,001 --> 00:23:02,000
Domain names are being listed
at the rate of 14,000 a month.

458
00:23:02,001 --> 00:23:06,001
Netscape says it will soon be out with
a new software package that makes it

459
00:23:06,001 --> 00:23:08,000
easy to create your own webpage.

460
00:23:08,001 --> 00:23:13,001
It's called Navigator Gold 2.0.
It will be available free on the net at the end

461
00:23:13,001 --> 00:23:16,000
