462
00:23:16,001 --> 00:23:20,001
But two UC Berkeley graduate students
say they have found a security

463
00:23:20,001 --> 00:23:22,000
gap in Netscape's web browser.

464
00:23:22,001 --> 00:23:25,000
They say a knowledgeable
computer user can break their

465
00:23:25,000 --> 00:23:27,000
existing security code in a minute.

466
00:23:27,001 --> 00:23:31,000
Netscape has acknowledged the problem
and said a fix is on the way.

467
00:23:31,000 --> 00:23:35,001
If you're trying to find a new CD-ROM
