Morse MacFadden PR company.

484
00:24:35,000 --> 00:24:37,001
Well, that's it for this week's Computer News.
Stewart?

485
00:24:38,000 --> 00:24:42,001
Before we wrap things up, let me tell
you about one terrific program I found.

486
00:24:42,001 --> 00:24:46,001
If you like computer games and you've
always wanted to write your own games, but

487
